# Trust My Card — platform-wide configuration
#
# Copy: cp config/platform.env.example config/platform.env
# Loaded by config/load-env.mjs for all apps (backend, website, admin, marketing preview).
#
# Per-app infra (DATABASE_URL, BACKEND_API_URL, …): env/profiles/$TMC_ENV/{backend,website,admin}.env
#
# See docs/infrastructure/environments.md
#
# --- Meta Pixel (wallet app) ---
# Loads when TMC_ENV=production, META_PIXEL_ID is set, and NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL origin matches META_PIXEL_APP_URL.
# META_PIXEL_APP_URL=https://mytrustvisa.cards
# META_PIXEL_ID=
# Production control plane managed values. Keep these permanent empty placeholders
# after `scripts/config-update.sh init` has been verified on the VPS.
WEBSITE_DOMAIN=""
META_PIXEL_ID=""
